[@baosky/plugin](#readme) / [commands](#readme) / registerDiffInformationCommand

###### Function: registerDiffInformationCommand()

> **registerDiffInformationCommand**(`command`: `string`, `callback`: (`diff`: [`LineChange`](#linechange)[], ...`args`: `any`[]) => `any`, `thisArg?`: `any`): [`Disposable`](#disposable)

Registers a diff information command that can be invoked via a keyboard shortcut,
a menu item, an action, or directly.

Diff information commands are different from ordinary [commands](#registercommand) as
they only execute when there is an active diff editor when the command is called, and the diff
information has been computed. Also, the command handler of an editor command has access to
the diff information.

## Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Description |
| ------ | ------ | ------ |
| `command` | `string` | A unique identifier for the command. |
| `callback` | (`diff`: [`LineChange`](#linechange)[], ...`args`: `any`[]) => `any` | A command handler function with access to the [diff information](#linechange). |
| `thisArg?` | `any` | The `this` context used when invoking the handler function. |

## Returns

Disposable which unregisters this command on disposal.


[@baosky/plugin](#readme) / [commands](#readme) / registerHandler

