| Parameter | Type | Description |
| ------ | ------ | ------ |
| `selector` | [`DocumentSelector`](#documentselector) | A selector that defines the documents this provider is applicable to. |
| `provider` | [`CompletionItemProvider`](#completionitemprovider) | A completion provider. |
| ...`triggerCharacters` | `string`[] | Trigger completion when the user types one of the characters, like `.` or `:`. |

## Returns

A [disposable](#disposable) that unregisters this provider when being disposed.


