[@baosky/plugin](#readme) / [window](#readme) / activeNotebookEditor

###### Variable: activeNotebookEditor

> `const` **activeNotebookEditor**: [`NotebookEditor`](#notebookeditor) \| `undefined`

The currently active [notebook editor](#notebookeditor) or `undefined`. The active editor is the one
that currently has focus or, when none has focus, the one that has changed
input most recently.


[@baosky/plugin](#readme) / [window](#readme) / activeTerminal

###### Variable: activeTerminal

> **activeTerminal**: [`Terminal`](#terminal) \| `undefined`

The currently active terminal or undefined. The active terminal is the one
that currently has focus or most recently had focus.


[@baosky/plugin](#readme) / [window](#readme) / activeTextEditor

###### Variable: activeTextEditor

> **activeTextEditor**: [`TextEditor`](#texteditor) \| `undefined`

The currently active editor or `undefined`. The active editor is the one
that currently has focus or, when none has focus, the one that has changed
input most recently.


