| <a id="tooltip"></a> `tooltip?` | `string` \| [`MarkdownString`](#markdownstring) | The tooltip text when you hover over this item. *Note* that this property can be set late during [resolving](#inlayhintsproviderresolveinlayhint) of inlay hints. |


