| `uri` | [`Uri`](#uri) | URI of the JavaScript module to preload |
| `provides?` | `string` \| readonly `string`[] | Value for the `provides` property |

#### Returns

`NotebookRendererScript`

## Properties

| Property | Type | Description |
| ------ | ------ | ------ |
| <a id="provides"></a> `provides` | readonly `string`[] | APIs that the preload provides to the renderer. These are matched against the `dependencies` and `optionalDependencies` arrays in the notebook renderer contribution point. |
| <a id="uri"></a> `uri` | [`Uri`](#uri) | URI of the JavaScript module to preload. This module must export an `activate` function that takes a context object that contains the notebook API. |


