[@baosky/plugin](#readme) / DebugConfigurationProviderTriggerKind

### Enumeration: DebugConfigurationProviderTriggerKind

A DebugConfigurationProviderTriggerKind specifies when the `provideDebugConfigurations` method of a `DebugConfigurationProvider` should be called.
Currently there are two situations:
 (1) providing debug configurations to populate a newly created `launch.json`
 (2) providing dynamically generated configurations when the user asks for them through the UI (e.g. via the "Select and Start Debugging" command).
A trigger kind is used when registering a `DebugConfigurationProvider` with [debug.registerDebugConfigurationProvider](#registerdebugconfigurationprovider).

## Enumeration Members

| Enumeration Member | Value | Description |
| ------ | ------ | ------ |
| <a id="dynamic"></a> `Dynamic` | `2` | `DebugConfigurationProvider.provideDebugConfigurations` is called to provide dynamically generated debug configurations when the user asks for them through the UI (e.g. via the "Select and Start Debugging" command). |
| <a id="initial"></a> `Initial` | `1` | `DebugConfigurationProvider.provideDebugConfigurations` is called to provide the initial debug configurations for a newly created launch.json. |


