Represents the debug console mode.

## Enumeration Members

| Enumeration Member | Value | Description |
| ------ | ------ | ------ |
| <a id="mergewithparent"></a> `MergeWithParent` | `1` | Debug session should share debug console with its parent session. This value has no effect for sessions which do not have a parent session. |
| <a id="separate"></a> `Separate` | `0` | Debug session should have a separate debug console. |


