| <a id="indentoutdent"></a> `IndentOutdent` | `2` | Insert two new lines: - the first one indented which will hold the cursor - the second one at the same indentation level |
| <a id="none"></a> `None` | `0` | Insert new line and copy the previous line's indentation. |
| <a id="outdent"></a> `Outdent` | `3` | Insert new line and outdent once (relative to the previous line's indentation). |


