| <a id="id"></a> `id` | `readonly` | `string` | A unique ID for this participant. |
| <a id="ondidreceivefeedback"></a> `onDidReceiveFeedback` | `public` | [`Event`](#event)\<[`ChatResultFeedback`](#chatresultfeedback)\> | An event that fires whenever feedback for a result is received, e.g. when a user up- or down-votes a result. The passed [result](#chatresultfeedbackresult) is guaranteed to be the same instance that was previously returned from this chat participant. |
| <a id="requesthandler"></a> `requestHandler` | `public` | [`ChatRequestHandler`](#chatrequesthandler) | The handler for requests to this participant. |

