[@baosky/plugin](#readme) / CommentController

### Interface: CommentController

A comment controller is able to provide [comments](#commentthread) support to the editor and
provide users various ways to interact with comments.

## Properties

| Property | Modifier | Type | Description |
| ------ | ------ | ------ | ------ |
| <a id="commentingrangeprovider"></a> `commentingRangeProvider?` | `public` | [`CommentingRangeProvider`](#commentingrangeprovider) | Optional commenting range provider. Provide a list [ranges](#range) which support commenting to any given resource uri. If not provided, users can leave comments in any document opened in the editor. |
| <a id="id"></a> `id` | `readonly` | `string` | The id of this comment controller. |
| <a id="label"></a> `label` | `readonly` | `string` | The human-readable label of this comment controller. |
| <a id="options"></a> `options?` | `public` | [`CommentOptions`](#commentoptions) | Comment controller options |
| <a id="reactionhandler"></a> `reactionHandler?` | `public` | (`comment`: [`Comment`](#comment), `reaction`: [`CommentReaction`](#commentreaction)) => [`Thenable`](#thenable)\<`void`\> | Optional reaction handler for creating and deleting reactions on a [comment](#comment). |

## Methods

### createCommentThread()

> **createCommentThread**(`uri`: [`Uri`](#uri), `range`: [`Range`](#range), `comments`: [`Comment`](#comment)[]): [`CommentThread`](#commentthread)

Create a [comment thread](#commentthread). The comment thread will be displayed in visible text editors (if the resource matches)
and Comments Panel once created.

#### Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Description |
| ------ | ------ | ------ |
| `uri` | [`Uri`](#uri) | The uri of the document the thread has been created on. |
| `range` | [`Range`](#range) | The range the comment thread is located within the document. |
| `comments` | [`Comment`](#comment)[] | The ordered comments of the thread. |

#### Returns

### dispose()

> **dispose**(): `void`

Dispose this comment controller.

Once disposed, all [comment threads](#commentthread) created by this comment controller will also be removed from the editor
and Comments Panel.

#### Returns

`void`


