| <a id="ignoredeleteevents"></a> `ignoreDeleteEvents` | `boolean` | true if this file system watcher has been created such that it ignores delete file system events. |
| <a id="ondidchange"></a> `onDidChange` | [`Event`](#event)\<[`Uri`](#uri)\> | An event which fires on file/folder change. |
| <a id="ondidcreate"></a> `onDidCreate` | [`Event`](#event)\<[`Uri`](#uri)\> | An event which fires on file/folder creation. |
| <a id="ondiddelete"></a> `onDidDelete` | [`Event`](#event)\<[`Uri`](#uri)\> | An event which fires on file/folder deletion. |

