| <a id="maxresults"></a> `maxResults?` | `number` | The maximum number of results to search for |
| <a id="previewoptions"></a> `previewOptions?` | [`TextSearchPreviewOptions`](#textsearchpreviewoptions) | Options to specify the size of the result text preview. |
| <a id="usedefaultexcludes"></a> `useDefaultExcludes?` | `boolean` | Whether to use the default and user-configured excludes. Defaults to true. |
