| Parameter | Type | Description |
| ------ | ------ | ------ |
| `range?` | [`NotebookRange`](#notebookrange) | A notebook range. |

#### Returns

[`NotebookCell`](#notebookcell)[]

The cells contained by the range or all cells.

### save()

> **save**(): [`Thenable`](#thenable)\<`boolean`\>

Save the document. The saving will be handled by the corresponding [serializer](#notebookserializer).

#### Returns

[`Thenable`](#thenable)\<`boolean`\>

A promise that will resolve to true when the document
has been saved. Will return false if the file was not dirty or when save failed.


