the formatting-feature.

## Methods

### provideOnTypeFormattingEdits()

> **provideOnTypeFormattingEdits**(`document`: [`TextDocument`](#textdocument), `position`: [`Position`](#position), `ch`: `string`, `options`: [`FormattingOptions`](#formattingoptions), `token`: [`CancellationToken`](#cancellationtoken)): [`ProviderResult`](#providerresult)\<[`TextEdit`](#textedit)[]\>

Provide formatting edits after a character has been typed.

The given position and character should hint to the provider
what range the position to expand to, like find the matching `{`
when `}` has been entered.

