## Properties

| Property | Modifier | Type | Description |
| ------ | ------ | ------ | ------ |
| <a id="accessibilityinformation"></a> `accessibilityInformation` | `public` | [`AccessibilityInformation`](#accessibilityinformation) | Accessibility information used when a screen reader interacts with this StatusBar item. |
