| <a id="isactive"></a> `isActive` | `readonly` | `boolean` | Whether or not the tab is currently active. This is dictated by being the selected tab in the group. |
| <a id="isdirty"></a> `isDirty` | `readonly` | `boolean` | Whether or not the dirty indicator is present on the tab. |
| <a id="ispinned"></a> `isPinned` | `readonly` | `boolean` | Whether or not the tab is pinned (pin icon is present). |
