| <a id="shellargs"></a> `shellArgs?` | `string` \| `string`[] | Args for the custom shell executable. A string can be used on Windows only which allows specifying shell args in [command-line format](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-au/08dfcab2-eb6e-49a4-80eb-87d4076c98c6). |
