| <a id="strictenv"></a> `strictEnv?` | `boolean` | Whether the terminal process environment should be exactly as provided in `TerminalOptions.env`. When this is false (default), the environment will be based on the window's environment and also apply configured platform settings like `terminal.integrated.windows.env` on top. When this is true, the complete environment must be provided as nothing will be inherited from the process or any configuration. |


