| `token` | [`CancellationToken`](#cancellationtoken) | A cancellation token. |

#### Returns

[`ProviderResult`](#providerresult)\<[`Timeline`](#timeline)\>

The [timeline result](#TimelineResult) or a thenable that resolves to such. The lack of a result
can be signaled by returning `undefined`, `null`, or an empty array.


