| `token` | [`CancellationToken`](#cancellationtoken) | A cancellation token indicating that drag has been cancelled. |

#### Returns

`void` \| [`Thenable`](#thenable)\<`void`\>

### handleDrop()?

> `optional` **handleDrop**(`target`: `T`, `dataTransfer`: [`DataTransfer`](#datatransfer), `token`: [`CancellationToken`](#cancellationtoken)): `void` \| [`Thenable`](#thenable)\<`void`\>

Called when a drag and drop action results in a drop on the tree that this `DragAndDropController` belongs to.

